WEBVTT

00:23:27.924 --> 00:23:30.012
and you couldn't even ask somebody,

00:23:30.036 --> 00:23:32.154
"Hey, where did you see this written?"

00:23:32.178 --> 00:23:34.293
And more often than not
you couldn't find it.

00:23:34.317 --> 00:23:36.848
AG: I want to ask you
a little bit about leadership,

00:23:36.872 --> 00:23:39.738
which obviously
is a core driver of culture.

00:23:40.405 --> 00:23:42.705
Adam seemed to do a lot of preaching

00:23:42.729 --> 00:23:46.170
about what WeWork was going to accomplish,

00:23:46.194 --> 00:23:48.817
what the values were,
what the mission was.

00:23:48.841 --> 00:23:51.879
Do you think he believed
all of what he was saying,

00:23:51.903 --> 00:23:55.389
or was he hoping other people
would drink the Kool-Aid?

00:23:55.885 --> 00:23:57.485
DF: I think he believed it.